      "writtenOn": "2020-12-14T10:53:42Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I think this should be the opposite: prebuilt_java_library has a dependency to a prebuilt APEX where its dex impl can be found. It\u0027s the java library that needs an output from the APEX. So the APEX should be the dependency of the library.\n\nThen we don\u0027t need to have the extracted paths in ApexInfo struct and the hack like PathForModuleWithoutVariantOut.",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 215,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 230,
        "endChar": 2
      },
      "revId": "c7e6e33247b0d8906d04c46194e3ea006f7e9b15",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
